{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and take it. Then move to location, check properties, and perform task. If path blocked, find new path. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsPathBlocked    /> <Action ID = FindNewPath    />",
